WEBVTT

00:13:56.939 --> 00:14:01.046
The other swans looked at him
and thought how beautiful he was.

00:14:01.485 --> 00:14:03.467
"Come with us," they said.

00:14:04.159 --> 00:14:05.310
And he did.

00:14:05.334 --> 00:14:08.365
(Bird sounds)

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:15.943
Well, Tiara, I hope you
have enjoyed this story

00:14:15.967 --> 00:14:19.167
as much as I enjoyed
reading this story to you.

00:14:20.009 --> 00:14:23.762
I cannot wait to be with you again
and hold you in my arms.

00:14:24.731 --> 00:14:26.731
All my love, your daddy, Owen.

00:14:27.303 --> 00:14:29.604
Lots of love, I miss you
with all my heart.

00:14:29.628 --> 00:14:31.895
Goodbye for now, my love. Bye bye.